category: Devel
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Tool to generate CPU_FLAGS_* for your CPU"
ldesc: "The program attempts to obtain the identification and capabilities
of the currently used CPU, and print the matching set of CPU_FLAGS_*
flags for Gentoo."
